## Quick Checklist Summary

- [ ] Wireframes & design system ready.  
- [ ] Next.js + Redux Toolkit + Tailwind skeleton set up.  
- [ ] Core features (catalog, cart, checkout) implemented.  
- [ ] API integration via React Query.  
- [ ] Stripe checkout integrated.  
- [ ] Auth flow with JWT.  
- [ ] Accessibility & SEO best practices applied.  
- [ ] Unit, integration, and E2E tests written.  
- [ ] CI/CD pipeline configured.  
- [ ] Performance optimizations in place.  
- [ ] Monitoring & analytics added.  
- [ ] Security hardening completed.  

Once you hit “All boxes checked,” you’re ready to launch a fast, secure, and delightful e‑commerce frontend that scales with your business. Happy coding!
